<title>USA: First United Bancshares 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>First United Bancshares 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>EL DORADO, Ark. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First United Bancshares Inc on Tuesday said it earned $18.3 million, or $2.21 per share, in 1996, compared with $15.2 million, or $1.96, the previous year.</p>
<p>The company did not issue a release containing its fourth-quarter results. Officials there were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>The bank has $1.5 billion in assets and 11 affiliate banks in Arkansas and Texas.</p>
</text>
